---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title={"Contact Us | Utah | Book Now | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Contact Tangible Mental Health in Provo or Orem for therapy. Email frontdesk@tangiblementalhealth.com or call 435-485-7420. Serving Provo, Orem & nearby."}>
<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:91;--mrows:66">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/14/13/27;--m:1/2/7/10;--dz:6;--mz:7"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/bg-2-1-primary-square-ea8261.png" alt="Logo of Utah Valley University featuring the university name in green text with lines above and below." width="1212" height="1078" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/3/10/15;--m:7/2/13/10"><div class="rte"><h1><strong>UVU Relief</strong></h1><p>We at Tangible were shocked to hear the terrible news of what took place in our community. This is our community and we care deeply for all that were impacted by this event.  Below you’ll find a list of providers that have opened their doors in support for those impacted by this event. </p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:13/3/21/12;--m:13/2/19/10;--dz:2"><div class="rte"><h3><strong>Tangible Therapy</strong></h3><p class="sm"><strong>Offers free sessions to those in attendance</strong></p><p class="sm"><strong>Email<br/></strong><a href="mailto:frontdesk@tangiblementalhealth.com?" rel="noopener" target="_blank">frontdesk@tangiblementalhealth.com</a></p><p class="sm"><strong>Phone</strong></p><p class="sm"><a href="tel:4352828086" rel="noopener" target="_blank">435-282-8086 (call)</a></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:13/15/22/27;--m:37/2/43/10;--dz:3;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3><strong>Cascade Counseling</strong></h3><p><strong>Offers free sessions to those in attendance</strong></p><p><strong>Phone</strong></p><p><a href="tel:+13854129880">(385) 412-9880</a></p><p><strong>Website</strong></p><p>https://www.cascadecounselingutah.com/</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:23/3/33/15;--m:19/2/25/10;--dz:4;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><h3><strong>Life Empowered Therapy Services</strong></h3><p><strong>Offers free sessions to those in attendance</strong></p><p><strong>Phone</strong></p><p>(801) 695-4452</p><p><strong>Website</strong></p><p>https://lifeempoweredtherapyservices.com/</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:23/15/33/27;--m:43/2/49/10;--dz:5;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h3><strong>Wellspring Healing and Therapy</strong></h3><p><strong>Offers free sessions for those affected through 9/19</strong></p><p><strong>Phone</strong></p><p>801-252-6868</p><p><strong>Website</strong></p><p>https://wellspringhealingandtherapy.com/?utm_source=GBP&amp;utm_medium=Organic&amp;utm_campaign=Organic</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:32/3/41/15;--m:25/2/31/10;--dz:6;--mz:5"><div class="rte"><h3><strong>Cameron Armstrong LCSW</strong></h3><p><strong>Offers free sessions for those in attendance</strong></p><p><strong>Phone</strong></p><p>801-830-5251</p><p><strong>Website</strong></p><p>https://cameron-r-armstrong.com/</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:33/15/41/27;--m:49/2/55/10;--dz:6;--mz:5"><div class="rte"><h3><strong>Lighthouse Trauma Therapy</strong></h3><p><strong>Offers free sessions for those in attendance</strong></p><p><strong>Phone</strong></p><p>(801) 921-6517</p><p><strong>Website</strong></p><p>https://lighthousetraumatherapy.com/</p></div></div>
